{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-46","no":"EP.46","tag":"第46话 · 所有天空的日食","title":"所有天空的日食","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-46:1","s":"n","t":"门后没有地面。只有落脚处会浮出黑色板块，脚一抬，板块就消失。","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:2","s":"n","t":"没有上下之分。远处悬着一轮黑太阳，不放光，反而吸走光。"},{"id":"ep-46:3","s":"yun","t":"空亡。因为空着，什么都能装进去的位置。没想到我掌心里面长这样。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:4","s":"moka","t":"一想到在别人手心里，感觉真怪。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:5","s":"yun","t":"别踩掌纹。感情线断了，摩卡先生负责。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:6","s":"n","t":"没有人笑出来，因为笑声一出口，就被吸向黑太阳。"},{"id":"ep-46:7","s":"yeon","t":"连声音都吃？","x":"fear","im":true,"fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"suck","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:8","s":"pje","t":"什么都吃，所以不能久留。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:9","s":"n","t":"Yeoni取出口袋里的备忘本，第一行的字有点淡了。她用指尖沿着那一行又描了一遍。"},{"id":"ep-46:10","s":"sys","t":"[ Neo · 先是猫，后来是人 · 银发 · 爱唠叨 · 袜子 · 站在我这边 ]"},{"id":"ep-46:11","s":"yeon","t":"刚才听见门后有声音吧？说袜子要穿成一对。他就在这里某处。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:12","s":"pje","t":"那先找人，打架放后面。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:13","s":"moka","t":"找着找着就会打起来，一直这样不是吗。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:14","s":"n","t":"这时脚下摇晃起来。黑色板块间有什么坠落，是庞然大物，像楼房那么大的碎片。","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:15","s":"n","t":"十二宫所在的星之宫殿倒着坠下，屋顶的星一颗颗熄灭。","bg":"zwPalace","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"zwPalace","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwPalace","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwPalace 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:16","s":"n","t":"天文台飞船拖着破帆滑落，十二宫的天空皱成一张折叠的地图。","bg":"skyship","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"whoosh","scene":{"background":"skyship","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: skyship","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"skyship 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:17","s":"n","t":"二十七月宿神殿的钟响了一次，整座神殿随即向黑太阳倾斜。","bg":"nakshatra","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"bell","scene":{"background":"nakshatra","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: nakshatra","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"nakshatra 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:18","s":"n","t":"卡牌回廊的牌像暴风雪般飞散。最后，海上的五座岛缩得像玩具，翻滚着坠下来。","bg":"tarotHall","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"page","scene":{"background":"tarotHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotHall","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:19","s":"moka","t":"那是我们的岛！食伤之岛！","x":"angry","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:20","s":"yun","t":"五片天空全在往这里崩塌。黑月留着门，等我们进来。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:21","s":"yeon","t":"就因为我们进来，便全毁了？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:22","s":"yun","t":"不是毁，是吃。全吃完，这里就只剩一片天，只剩它。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:23","s":"n","t":"闰月指向黑太阳。倒塌的碎片绕着它转，一块块消失。"},{"id":"ep-46:24","s":"n","t":"黑太阳长出了眼睛，不只一只，每片坍塌的天空各一只，一共五只。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"warCommand","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:25","s":"heuk","t":"来吧，我等着呢，容器。","im":true,"fx":"reveal","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:26","s":"n","t":"太阳周围浮起一些名字，都是Yeoni在路上听过的。黑色化忌，黑月莉莉丝，罗睺的头与计都的尾，倒塌的高塔。"},{"id":"ep-46:27","s":"yun","t":"全是同一个家伙，只是在不同天空换了名字。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:28","s":"heuk","t":"名字越多越好，每吃一次，就多一个。"},{"id":"ep-46:29","s":"n","t":"太阳下伸出数百只黑手，每根手指都挂着某个人的名牌。"},{"id":"ep-46:30","s":"pje","t":"把那些名字还回去，没有一个属于你。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:31","s":"heuk","t":"雨水，你总叫我归还别人的东西，自己的却一次也没守住。"},{"id":"ep-46:32","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨攥紧伞柄，没有回答，只向前迈了一步，来到Yeoni前面。"},{"id":"ep-46:33","s":"heuk","t":"动手之前，先做交易吧。我很公平，这道理也是我教给那个记账的孩子的。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:34","s":"n","t":"一只黑手降到摩卡面前，掌中展开一个小舞台。正午太阳悬着，观众坐得满满的。"},{"id":"ep-46:35","s":"heuk","t":"火种，我把你岛上的歌全还给你，连掌声一起。但你得在这里放手。"},{"id":"ep-46:36","s":"moka","t":"我们岛的歌，是我们自己唱回来的，不是你给的。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:37","s":"n","t":"摩卡用手背挥开舞台。小小的舞台化作灰烬散去。"},{"id":"ep-46:38","s":"moka","t":"而且掌声不是借来的，是赢来的。连区别都不懂，就别演出。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:39","s":"heuk","t":"算命的，你不想回家吗？把时辰还给你，卯时，名字也还你。"},{"id":"ep-46:40","s":"n","t":"掌上浮起一只钟，指针在五点二十分附近颤抖。闰月的目光无法从指针上挪开。"},{"id":"ep-46:41","s":"yun","t":"那个，是真的？","x":"void","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:42","s":"yeon","t":"闰月先生。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-46:43","s":"n","t":"闰月伸出手，指尖几乎碰到钟时，又停住了。戴着手套的手指在空中发抖。"},{"id":"ep-46:44","s":"yun","t":"真的也不要。拿了它，我就能回家，可Yeoni会留在这里。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-46:45","s":"yun","t":"而且我的时辰，是我靠生时校正找回来的，没有理由向你领。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:46","s":"n","t":"黑手来到徐寒雨面前。掌上是下雨的车站，第一个春天的车站，长椅上放着信封。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:47","s":"heuk","t":"雨水，我让你回去，回到那天那个车站。这次我不插手。那孩子、信封、大海，全是你的。"},{"id":"ep-46:48","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨屏住呼吸。车站的雨声太真实，信封上的字也看得见：一起去海边。"},{"id":"ep-46:49","s":"pje","t":"回到那个春天。","x":"waver","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"water","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:50","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:51","s":"n","t":"Yeoni只叫了她的名字，不劝阻，也不拉住她，让她自己选。"},{"id":"ep-46:52","s":"pje","t":"回到那个春天，这个春天Yeoni给我的伞就会消失，那把缠了三层胶带的伞。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:53","s":"pje","t":"不去。我要在这个春天偿还。","x":"resolve"},{"id":"ep-46:54","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨用手盖住车站，安静地，像放下攥了很久的东西。小小的车站化成雨水流走。"},{"id":"ep-46:55","s":"heuk","t":"一个比一个无趣。那就直接问容器吧。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"impact","sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:56","s":"n","t":"最后一只手在Yeoni面前摊开。Neo蜷缩在掌心，闭眼的身体像玻璃般模糊，看不出是否还在呼吸。"},{"id":"ep-46:57","s":"heuk","t":"就是你忘掉的那个，连名字也记不起吧？腾空自己，我就还你。你成为容器，他也能一起待在里面，永远。"},{"id":"ep-46:58","s":"n","t":"Yeoni看着那张脸，名字与记忆都浮不上来，只有手掌热了。"},{"id":"ep-46:59","s":"n","t":"金光从Yeoni左手漏出，那是塔下紧握的金线渗入之处。光伸向黑手，又聚回掌心。","im":true,"fx":"metal","sfx":"chime","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:60","s":"heuk","t":"啊。"},{"id":"ep-46:61","s":"yeon","t":"这是什么？手怎么这么热？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-46:62","s":"n","t":"黑月的声音第一次动摇，五只眼睛同时望向Yeoni掌心。"},{"id":"ep-46:63","s":"heuk","t":"原来在那儿，我没吃完的碎片。"},{"id":"ep-46:64","s":"n","t":"数百只黑手一起扑来，朝着Yeoni，准确说，是她的左手。","bg":"handsRush","tone":"dark","bgm":"warDream","shot":"impact","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"angry"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"},"sfx":"slash","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:65","s":"pje","t":"Yeoni，退后！","x":"angry","im":true,"fx":"shake","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"shake","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:66","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨撑开伞，伞下倾泻雨水。雨立成一道墙，挡住黑手。手指每碰到雨，就有一个名牌掉下来。"},{"id":"ep-46:67","s":"moka","t":"没有火柴也行，我的火本来就从嘴里出来！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:68","s":"n","t":"摩卡深吸一口气，喊了出来，是说唱。节奏与歌词都乱七八糟，可声音里依然迸出火花，几只手被烧得缩回去。"},{"id":"ep-46:69","s":"yun","t":"我来吞，稍微让开一点。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-46:70","s":"n","t":"闰月摘掉手套，伸出手掌。黑手被吸过去，他的脸瞬间惨白。空亡的圆扩散到了手腕。"},{"id":"ep-46:71","s":"yeon","t":"停下！手上的东西越来越大了！","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:72","s":"yun","t":"这只手本来就是留着这种时候用的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-46:73","s":"n","t":"可黑手无穷无尽。雨墙逐渐变薄，摩卡的声音沙哑破裂，闰月膝盖一软。","bg":"handsRush","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:74","s":"heuk","t":"何必抵抗，交出一个容器，一切就结束了。"},{"id":"ep-46:75","s":"n","t":"Yeoni把漏着金光的左手抱在胸前。连这个也交出去，就没有路回到那个人身边了。不知缘由，却唯独这一点，她知道。"},{"id":"ep-46:76","s":"yeon","t":"闰月先生，这个，这道光，是什么？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:77","s":"yun","t":"是庚，猫先生的金。你这只容器里，还留着一片。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:78","s":"yun","t":"你的命式原本就五气俱全，木、火、土、水，还有那道金。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:79","s":"n","t":"闰月依次指向徐寒雨、摩卡、自己，还有Yeoni。"},{"id":"ep-46:80","s":"yun","t":"恰好，这里五种都在。火、土、水、木，金在Yeoni手里。","x":"sly","im":true,"fx":"stars","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:81","s":"yeon","t":"把五气聚在一起的话……","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-46:82","s":"yun","t":"日食由日月重叠而成。五气运行一周，就能解开重叠。大概。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:83","s":"moka","t":"怎么这么多大概！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:84","s":"n","t":"就在此时，雨墙裂开，一只黑手钻过缝隙。它抓的不是Yeoni，而是徐寒雨的右腕，曾留着环形伤疤的位置。"},{"id":"ep-46:85","s":"heuk","t":"那就先吃水。五个少一个，就什么也转不起来。"},{"id":"ep-46:86","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨被拖向黑太阳，雨伞脱手。缠着胶带的伞柄在黑板块上骨碌碌滚动。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:87","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:88","s":"n","t":"Yeoni没有思考，捡起滚来的伞就跑。漏着金光的左手抓住伞，右手抓住徐寒雨另一只手。"},{"id":"ep-46:89","s":"pje","t":"松手！你也会被拖走！","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:90","s":"yeon","t":"不松。刚才你选了我，这次换我选。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:91","s":"n","t":"两人连成一团被拖去。摩卡抓住Yeoni的书包带，闰月抱住摩卡的腰。四个人连成一串悬着，黑太阳越来越近。"},{"id":"ep-46:92","s":"moka","t":"这算什么拔河！我们这队也太弱了！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:93","s":"yun","t":"拔河本来就要最后一鼓作气。还不是时候。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:94","s":"n","t":"这时Yeoni左手的金光再次散开，沿着伞柄、徐寒雨的手腕流去。黑手指碰到光，猛地一缩，稍稍松开。"},{"id":"ep-46:95","s":"heuk","t":"把那道光交出来，那本来就是我的。"},{"id":"ep-46:96","s":"yeon","t":"少来，我备忘上写了，站在我这边。我的同伴，不是你的东西。","x":"angry"}]}
